{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"54b5a5fdd7098341","type":"text","text":"# Starting from a typed function\n\nIf you write a typed python function in a file, you can direct PNE at that file and it will analyze the function.\n\n```python\ndef add(a: int, b: int) -> int:\n\t\"\"\"adds two numbers together\"\"\"\n    return a + b\n```","x":-2020,"y":-260,"width":440,"height":240},
		{"id":"a41e9c7fd55b3b24","type":"text","text":"Frontend JSON For The Same Schema\n\nProduced with:\n```python\nadd_schema.model_dump(mode='json', exclude_defaults=True)\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"add\",\n  \"callableId\": \"b414e3e8a1cc84d0\",\n  \"category\": [\n    \"examples\",\n    \"integer_math\"\n  ],\n  \"filePath\": [\n    \"/Users/tristan-artmatr/Library/CloudStorage/Nextcloud-admin@t-home-server/projects/python-node-editor/examples/integer_math.py\",\n    1 // Line number\n  ],\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"a\": {\n      \"type\": \"int\",\n      \"value\": null\n    },\n    \"b\": {\n      \"type\": \"int\",\n      \"value\": null\n    }\n  },\n  \"outputs\": {\n    \"return\": {\n      \"type\": \"int\",\n      \"value\": null\n    }\n  }\n}\n```","x":300,"y":-620,"width":980,"height":980},
		{"id":"a237e0b7fe154416","type":"text","text":"```json\n{\n    \"nodes\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": \"3e1b4132-8a5a-4f74-b518-47b3b45fa853\",\n            \"data\": {\n                \"callableId\": \"b414e3e8a1cc84d0\",\n                \"arguments\": {\n                    \"a\": {\n                        \"type\": \"int\",\n                        \"value\": 1\n                    },\n                    \"b\": {\n                        \"type\": \"int\",\n                        \"value\": 2\n                    }\n                },\n                \"outputs\": {\n                    \"return\": {\n                        \"type\": \"int\"\n                    }\n                }\n            },\n            \"position\": {\n                \"x\": 270,\n                \"y\": 256\n            }\n        }\n    ],\n    \"edges\": []\n}\n```","x":1563,"y":-740,"width":757,"height":780},
		{"id":"c2f3d6ad58a3d1be","type":"text","text":"`pne-analyze` FunctionSchema For `add`\n\nSource command:\n```bash\nuv run pne-analyze examples/integer_math.py -v\n```\n\n```python\nFunctionSchema(\n    name='add',\n    callable_id='b414e3e8a1cc84d0',\n    category=['examples', 'integer_math'],\n    file_path=[\n        '/Users/tristan-artmatr/Library/CloudStorage/Nextcloud-admin@t-home-server/projects/python-node-editor/examples/integer_math.py',\n        1,\n    ],\n    doc=None,\n    arguments={\n        'a': DataWrapper(type='int', value=None),\n        'b': DataWrapper(type='int', value=None),\n    },\n    dynamic_input_type=None,\n    output_style='single',\n    outputs={\n        'return': DataWrapper(type='int', value=None),\n    },\n    cached_types=[],\n    auto_generated=False,\n)\n```","x":-1300,"y":-540,"width":920,"height":980}
